      "statistical_basis": "The coefficients c and b are obtained by fitting C(gamma, x) = c(gamma, L) x ln(x) + b(gamma, L) x within x in [8, L]. Finite-size scaling is performed with the pyfssa package, and the critical exponents and gamma_c are reported with uncertainties (zeta = 0.00 ± 0.01, nu = 1.26 ± 0.48, gamma_c = (0.13 ± 0.01)J). The uncertainty convention is not specified.",
